  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_header.webp\" alt=\"横幅标题\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_promo2.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 促销横幅\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_overview.webp\" alt=\"概览横幅\"></h2>\n<p>准备好开始你自己的《驯龙高手》冒险了吗？跳入一个充满巨龙的世界，体验原汁原味的《驯龙高手》！在你的世界中骑乘、驯服并繁殖各种龙。在探索地牢最深处时与它们并肩作战，或者骑着它们平静地目送夕阳。携带维京武器与盔甲翱翔探索，掠夺直到心满意足。在最高的火山峰顶安营扎寨，喝一杯麦酒来强化自身！这一切在<strong>《伯克之爪》（Claws of Berk）</strong>中皆可实现。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/new-berks-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fnew-berks-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持 Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SR_HLmOQy1s?si=w83UfReiLN4lH3WV\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_features.webp\" alt=\"特色横幅\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>地牢</strong> - 渴望冒险？是时候挑战一座结构复杂的地牢了，从它的顶峰一路深入至最底层。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>独特的世界生成</strong> - 和平地飞越高耸的山脉和广袤的平原，或者在深海表面掠过。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>维京人与更多</strong> - 这是什么？你发现了一艘维京船和一个维京村庄，这个精彩的世界还会为你准备什么惊喜呢。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>巨龙</strong> - 野生动物可能有些危险，但别担心，这些飞行蜥蜴更喜欢大型猎物。拥有超过50个不同物种和1000多种变种，你能驯服从最小到最大的这些壮丽生物吗？</li>\n<li><strong>以及更多内容……！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_discord.webp\" alt=\"整合包 Discord\"></a></p>\n<h3>标准免责声明</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是游玩此整合包的 YouTube 博主或内容创作者，请在描述中添加指向本页面的链接，以便他人知晓你所使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允许在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上传此整合包或其任何修改版本，这包括重新分发到其他任何网站。</strong> (<em>除非获得我的明确许可</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>查看这些精彩的视频！</h2>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jPAlYvDd41I?si=pM9N9N6aCFY686Bx\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XZCNY00iXv8?si=IvpPY6fK1P9QncNU\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0HHccMlR5Hw?si=Y8INHtccITw2fStF\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ha7mUe6EEYE?si=ubYwNR71biA4es5H\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R8E_eqNturI?si=cx1tv1Pbs29bS72n\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0yrkfOdBVPE?si=J4WdnEDDpkLSXsM3\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bAQK2olfPNI?si=xhUWJRK31TxUkr5X\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PiED62zs59Y?si=MYQ57nWfi-ku3BLf\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>",
